# Keep the upload to what the build and the function actually need.
# backend/ and frontend/ must stay: the function imports backend/pact and the
# build command runs in frontend/.
#
# Deliberately not excluding docs/ — it is small, committed, and useful to
# reviewers. Excluding a path here also excludes it from the function's file
# tracing, so only add entries that genuinely must not ship.
backend/.venv
backend/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
data
.openhands
*.log
.env
